# Shipping live files

App owns I/O + yaml. No live DB folder today (`database/shipping-label-generator/` reserved). ShipStation secrets are warehouse-shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files/` | Input desfiles |
| `Shipping Label Generator/DTF Des Files - Processed/` | Archived inputs |
| `Shipping Label Generator/shipping_config.yaml` | Tuneables |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | Only ShipStation secrets file (warehouse-wide) |
| `Output/Shipping Label Generator/` | Labels and batch PDFs |
| `Logs/Shipping Label Generator/` | Shipping run logs |
